{"about_the_game":"In a world where living disasters have eradicated people\u2019s homes, the protagonist sets out on a journey with Hounimal, the village guardian, to restore homes to the world.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect and Place Furniture</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185010/extras/74cca39b6cbd71373ccd9e49dcc03942.poster.avif?t=1745549914\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185010/extras/74cca39b6cbd71373ccd9e49dcc03942.webm?t=1745549914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185010/extras/74cca39b6cbd71373ccd9e49dcc03942.mp4?t=1745549914\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Obtain various pieces of furniture during your journey and place them in Hounimal. The actions you can choose in battle will change depending on the furniture. (Of course, you can also enjoy them as interior decorations!)<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Simultaneous Turn-Based Command Battles</h2> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185010/extras/c4ac8335c7d2462ed4543439ce073a14.poster.avif?t=1745549914\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185010/extras/c4ac8335c7d2462ed4543439ce073a14.webm?t=1745549914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185010/extras/c4ac8335c7d2462ed4543439ce073a14.mp4?t=1745549914\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Command battles progress simultaneously with the enemy! Skillfully coordinate the protagonist and Hounimal, who randomly assist, to control the order of actions and gain an advantage in battle.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Re